{
  "_comment": [
    "Template for .agent-config.json - copy, edit, keep OUT of git:",
    "  cp .agent-config.example.json .agent-config.json",
    "mode OFF = analyse-only (exits still managed). Flip to LIVE deliberately.",
    "Values below are conservative baselines, NOT live tuning: the bot ratchets",
    "caps (max_trade_notional_usd, daily_kill_cap_usd, daily_giveback_min_peak_usd)",
    "and mode over time, so the live file drifts from this template - that is expected.",
    "Gates/signals default to shadow_mode=true (log-only); set false to arm.",
    "See docs/CONFIG.md for every key and docs/OPERATIONS.md for hot-reload rules."
  ],
